#: ConfigEditJson.qml:24
msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Rediger menystrukturen som JSON. Kvart element kan ha: name, icon, command "
"(køyrd gjennom skalet) eller action (ei økthandling: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (liste over "
"element) eller separator (true)."

